Engine-data round, review fixes for 0121 (DCS Control, 2026-11-25). [ofxr] dcs_motion_occlusion_fill becomes a mode and
the fill only acts on what it knows:
- The frame taken must show the farther surface itself at the place it is read, by a known rank (the cockpit's class, no
  MV, outside a rect, no previous class are unknown: no fill), and that place must not be the cockpit mask's.
- No previous class atlas (a reset pair, no stencil in either frame, a previous frame without MVs): the fill bit is
  cleared for the pair or view, the image is the one without the fill, byte for byte (tested).
- The previous-class pass also reads the previous frame's own MVs and marks, per cell, where that frame's model is at
  each output's instant (two-step fixed point along its MVs, bits 5 / 6 of the field's flags); with no nearer surface
  around in the current frame (behind a model that moved on) a pixel the model still covers at the instant is not
  filled (without it the fill painted the background over a model's trailing part). Where a nearer surface is around,
  the pixel is not filled if it may be that surface within half a cell (five probes), or that surface's own MVs do not
  hold (both frames differ along them at its cell: a rotor, propeller or afterburner), or the flow holds the pixel still
  while the world moves (content over it the G-buffer does not hold).
- Class texels past the class texture read as unknown, not as a surface.
- Mode 0 off, 1 only on pairs whose HUD / helmet symbology was taken out (hud_symbology), 2 every pair: a HUD left in the
  image, even semi-transparent, with an aircraft passing behind it, is moved by the one-frame sample (fixture: up to 9%
  worse there in mode 2), so 1 is the safe one. Taken in live (0066's LiveFlow / Snapshot occlusion_fill, kLiveOcclusionFill
  32, live_settings bits 40-41; a rebuild), the pass's pipeline and descriptor block made with dcs_motion whatever the key.
- Counters: the MVs' own count (the backoff's) is taken before the fill, which counts apart (16 uints at byte 128 of the
  counter buffer, CockpitMaskPairCounters::motion_filled_pixels).
- The previous frame's class copy is noted as read by the pair (note_reader) where its mask was not bound, so its ring
  entry is not reused under the GPU.
- static_assert that the fill bit (4096) is clear of the cell, output and 0104 quality bits; key in layer/ofxr_bridge.ini.
Fixtures (tests/fg_engine_data.inc): a previous camera turned 1.5 degrees (every frame drawn by its own camera, the MVs
carrying the turn), the headset's cell (8), 3X's instants (1/3, 2/3), no previous class atlas, mode 1, and a day case with
a spinning rotor (its look turns, its MVs say rigid) and a semi-transparent HUD (alpha 0.6) the aircraft passes behind.
Day, MVs at the periphery's texel, sRGB mae without / with the fill: behind a model 17.4 / 8.0, ahead 12.0 / 8.8, all
1.44 / 1.33; cell 8: behind 18.1 / 4.5, all 1.47 / 1.31; turned head: behind 17.1 / 6.8, all 1.51 / 1.40; t 1/3: behind
22.7 / 12.7; t 2/3: behind 11.3 / 4.9; night: behind 3.8 / 2.8; rotor disc 10.5 / 10.8 (cell 8: 13.2 / 14.2); glass HUD
24.0 / 24.5 (t 2/3: 24.9 / 27.2); without a previous atlas or in mode 1 identical. Cost (XRFG_TEST_FG_ENGINE_DATA_BENCH,
5424 x 5356, both eyes, mode 2): composition 1157 -> 1245 us median per pair (0121 alone: 1214). cockpit_mask_tests: the live parse of
the mode.
Touched functions (for merges): frame_synthesis.hlsl dcs_motion_previous_rank, new dcs_motion_previous_model_reaches,
dcs_motion_occlusion_fill (gates), dcs_motion_pixel's end (the fill after the count, its own count);
dcs_motion_previous.hlsl (new helpers); synthesizer: create_root_signature_and_pipelines (pass made with dcs_motion),
create_dcs_motion_resources (mode), kDcsMotionCounterBytes / harvest_dcs_motion (fill count), new
clear_dcs_motion_fill_bits, record_dcs_motion_previous_class (mode 1, bits cleared, t0 the previous MVs, fractions),
submit_pair (previous_class_read kept, note_reader); embedded_control (LiveFlow / Snapshot / adopt_live / live_flow_code
/ live_flow_of: occlusion_fill beside 0104's fg_quality), implicit_layer (read_dcs_motion_occlusion_fill returns a mode,
OfxrSectionValues::occlusion_fill, parse_ofxr_section), openxr_layer (session read, retire_async_arm's compare,
apply_embedded_control's options and change), cockpit_mask.hpp (motion_filled_pixels).
